    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sorelle is a whimsical 3D puzzle-platformer that immerses you in the magical seaside town of Isola Chiara.</strong><br><br>Meet sisters Alessandra, Bella and Capri. Life in their seaside town goes astray when a violent storm destroys preparations for the annual summer festival and shatters the Duomo\u2019s stained glass, scattering the magic of the town. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/90de7406eca39794ee41e6ade7109e6f.avif?t=1724655623\" width=640 height=201 /></span><br><br>The clock is ticking \u2014 the unrestrained magic seeks to return to the sea, the land, and the sky. Bestowed with fragments of this magic, the three sisters gain unique powers. Alessandra, the oldest and headstrong leader, harnesses the fluidity of the magic and gains the ability to levitate objects. Bella, the brash and brave middle sister, is granted strength to jump to new heights and break down obstacles. Capri, the curious and quiet youngest sister, is gifted with the ability to create light. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/9e22badd4c3768771c6a0a944e4ac9da.poster.avif?t=1724655623\" width=270 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/9e22badd4c3768771c6a0a944e4ac9da.webm?t=1724655623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/bccad1d352792b3f60333fac4372a242.poster.avif?t=1724655623\" width=270 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/bccad1d352792b3f60333fac4372a242.webm?t=1724655623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/3a6aaf6cf14446c9422ecf6369c15f5f.poster.avif?t=1724655623\" width=270 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/3a6aaf6cf14446c9422ecf6369c15f5f.webm?t=1724655623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/eea2eab63d31496b33f7c60dd6e51f24.poster.avif?t=1724655623\" width=270 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/eea2eab63d31496b33f7c60dd6e51f24.webm?t=1724655623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>The sisters realize it's up to them to save the summer festival and restore magic to the town. Swap between the three playable sisters and combine their unique powers to solve puzzles, explore the village, and strengthen the bonds of sisterhood.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/1d78cfc3fef6dc05788c95edae88b2df.avif?t=1724655623\" width=640 height=169 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>three Charming Playable Protagonists.<br></li><li>Dynamic puzzles that require creative use of every sisters\u2019 power.<br></li><li>Gorgeous and immersive Sicilian-inspired seaside scenery.<br></li><li>A heartwarming and family-centric story.<br></li><li>A whirling and magical original soundtrack.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/3106d2e95ecf8a5fe0c5c166c5579aa6.avif?t=1724655623\" width=640 height=201 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Sorelle is a whimsical 3D puzzle-platformer that immerses you in the magical seaside town of Isola Chiara.</strong><br><br>Meet sisters Alessandra, Bella and Capri. Life in their seaside town goes astray when a violent storm destroys preparations for the annual summer festival and shatters the Duomo\u2019s stained glass, scattering the magic of the town. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/90de7406eca39794ee41e6ade7109e6f.avif?t=1724655623\" width=640 height=201 /></span><br><br>The clock is ticking \u2014 the unrestrained magic seeks to return to the sea, the land, and the sky. Bestowed with fragments of this magic, the three sisters gain unique powers. Alessandra, the oldest and headstrong leader, harnesses the fluidity of the magic and gains the ability to levitate objects. Bella, the brash and brave middle sister, is granted strength to jump to new heights and break down obstacles. Capri, the curious and quiet youngest sister, is gifted with the ability to create light. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/9e22badd4c3768771c6a0a944e4ac9da.poster.avif?t=1724655623\" width=270 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/9e22badd4c3768771c6a0a944e4ac9da.webm?t=1724655623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/bccad1d352792b3f60333fac4372a242.poster.avif?t=1724655623\" width=270 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/bccad1d